== region-combo-all-three
BYN3002 28:9 arena `arena` does not live as long as `b`, which borrows it |arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block|copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough|
BYN3002 29:9 arena `arena` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it |arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block|copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough|
